{
  "id": "2KI.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "2KI",
  "reference": "Laitorinik 2 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 44,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kotesei Elisha mwaitab mosoget",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kirirji Elisha kwondo age ne bo osotikab werikab maotik, kolenji, Kigome otwogindeng’ung’ manong’otiondennyu: ak ingen ile kiiywei otwogindeng’ung’ Jehovah: ak kagonyo besendoindet komachei komut lagokyuk aeng’ koba koek otwogik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Elisha inendet, Imache ayaun nee? Mwawa; itinye nee eng’ go? Ak kile, Matinyei kiy age tugul eng’ go otwogindeng’ung’ ne chepto, kobate sotetab mwaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole anyun, Ui somjige terenik eng’ biguk tugul che bo kokweng’ung’, terenik che mami kiy, amat isom che ng’ering’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo iwe go, ak igerjige go koboto weriguk, ak irong’ji mwaata terenichoto tugul; ak ne kagonyi, iiste kwo taban. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwo anyun eng’ ole kimi inendet, kwo kogerigei go koboto werikyik; kiipchi ichek inendet terenik ak kirong’ji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingonyi terenik, kolenji werinnyi, Ibwa teret age. Ak kilenji inendet, Ma komi teret age, ak kisis mwaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konyo anyun komwachi chitab Kamuktaindet. Ak kile chichoto, Ui alde mwanichato, si iyaaktae besendang’ung’, ak iboisie che kang’et ak weriguk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha ak Chepsunamindet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwa Elisha Sunem betut age, ole kimi kwondo ne toogunot; ak kibirji inendet koamis. Ak betut age tugul ye kibunei yoto, ko kicham kowendi goyoto koamisiei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji inendet manong’otiondennyi, Keero, ageere ale ni ko chito ne tilil ne bo Kamuktaindet, ne cham kosiirtoi eng’ olinyo kotugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asomin ale, ngechopchi got ne ming’in kogakta gonnyo; si kindochi itogut, ak meset, ak ng’echeret, ak kit ne tebe tait; ak ye kanyo gonnyo, kotebe yoto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinyo yoto betut age, ak kiwa goyoto koru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Elisha Geasi otwogindennyi, Kuur Chepsunamindoni. Ak kingo kagoguur, konyo kwonyoto kotonon eng’ tainnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji otwogindennyi, Ilenji kwonyi, Keero, kaitoretech mising’ eng’ toretoni tugul te ni; imache keyaun nee? Imache kesomun kiy eng’ laitoriat, anan eng’ kiptaiyatab luget? Ak kiwolji kolenji, Amenye kwenutab bikyuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kile anyun Elisha, Kiyachi nee anyun? Ak kiwol Geasi kole, Matinyei werit iman, ak os manong’otiondennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile, Kuur inendet. Ak kingo kagoguur inendet, konyo kotonon eng’ kurgat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Elisha, Tun kapkora eng’ kenyit ne nyonei, itinye werit. Ak kile, Achicha, kiptaiyandennyu, inye chitab Kamuktaindet, amat imwachi lembech otwogindeng’ung’ ne chepto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimanach kwonyoto, ak kisich werit eng’ betunoto, ko kait kenyit, ko u ye kiga mwachi Elisha inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingoeet lakwanato, koba ak kwandanyi betut age ole mi bik che kesisiei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji lakwanato kwandanyi, Metinnyu, metinnyu. Ak kilenji chichoto otwogindennyi, Imutyi kamet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagonam inendet, ak komutyi kamet, kotiny kamet agoi kotonon asis, ak kime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitogosta kwo komogonji inendet itogutab chitab Kamuktaindet, ak kogerji inendet go, ak komanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak koguur manong’otiondennyi kolenji, Asomin ale iyokwa age eng’ otwogik, ak sigiriet age, alabat ole mi chitab Kamuktaindet, si aweek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile manong’otiondennyi, Amu nee si iwe ole mi inendet ra? Ama betut ne kaleel arawet, anan ko sabato. Ak kile, Ma ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koiito anyun sigiriet, ak kolenji otwogindennyi, Kweri, kebe; mat iwe mutyo, kobate ye kamwaun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwo anyun, ak koit ole mi chitab Kamuktaindet eng’ tulwetab Karmel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer chitab Kamuktaindet inendet eng’ ole loo, kolenji Geasi otwogindennyi, Keero, nin ko Chepsunamindet: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asomin ale, labat torokte, ak ilenji, Ichamege? Chamegei manong’otiondeng’ung’? Chamegei lakwet? Ak kiwol kole, Chamegei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingoit ole mitei chitab Kamuktaindet eng’ tulwet, konam kelyekyik. Ak kinyo Geasi korik konyo kolen kotoorta inendet; ago kile chitab Kamuktaindet, Mete: amu tinyei ng’wanindo eng’ muguleldanyi; ak kagoung’ena Jehovah, ma mwawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo komwa kole, Kigamage werit kiptaiyandennyu? Kima ale, Mat igena?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolenji anyun Elisha Geasi, Kermenge, ak inam kiroktanyu eng’ eung’ung’, ak iwe: ngot ituiye chi, ko mat igat; ak ngot kogatin chi, ko mat iwolji; ak inde kiroktanyu togetab lakwet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile kametab lakwet, Ko u ye sobei Jehovah, ak ko u ye sobei sobondang’ung’, ko mabagaktoin. Ak king’eet Elisha, kosub inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwa Geasi kondoe ichek, ak konde kirokto togetab lakwet; ago ma biit tweguno, anan kaset. Koweek anyun kotorokta inendet, ak kolenji, Tom kong’eet lakwet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingonyo go Elisha, ogeero, ko kagome lakwet, ak kaginde itogunnyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwo go anyun, ak kogerjigei go ichek aeng’u, ak kosa Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitogosta, ak korue lakwet, ak kotiing’e kutinnyi kutitab lakwet, ak kotiing’e konyekyik konyekab lakwet, ak kotiing’e eunekyik chechiget: ak koiitoegei baragutab lakwet; ak kilalang’it bortab lakwet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koweek anyun Elisha, ak kowendot eng’ go; ak kotogosta, ak koiitoegei inendet: ak kirion lakwet konyil tisab, ak kogos. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiguur Geasi kolenji, Kuur Chepsunamindet. Koguur anyun inendet. Ak kingonyo go ole mi Elisha, kolenji Elisha, Kanab wering’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwo go anyun, ak kobutyi kelyekyik ak kong’uruk kot koit ng’ony; ak kiganab werinnyi ak komanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwong’utik aeng’ che kiyai Eliisha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiweek Elisha Gilgal, ak kimi rubet emet; ak kitebyei werikab maotik eng’ tainnyi: ak kilenji otwogindennyi, Kotkot teret ne o, ak iyochi werikab maotik sogoriek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwa age mbar kwo kobut ngwek, ak kinyor ketitab motondoronik, ak kobut motondoronikab ketoto, kot konyiit ngoriet, ak konyo komurmurji teret ne mi sogoriek: amu kima nai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koluluk anyun kobwa ng’ony koam bik. Ak ye kiamei tuguchoto, kowaach, kole, Ee chitab Kamuktaindet, mi meet teret orit. Ak mata komuch koam tuguk che kimi teronoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kile inendet, Oibu busiek. Ak kirong’ji teret; ak kimwa kole, Olulugu koam bik. Ak kimata kobiit kiy ne ya eng’ teret.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinyo chito age eng’ Baal-salisa, ak kiipchi chitab Kamuktaindet makatinikab tongoanik, makatinik tiptem che bo sairik, ak mesisekab bek eng’ lolennyi. Ak kile, Igochi bik koam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile otwogindennyi, He! Andoi amitwogichu taitab bik bogol? Ago kile, Igochi bik koam; amu kamwa Jehovah ko u ni kole, Amei kot kotuuch. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konde anyun tainywa, ak kiamis bichoto, ak kotuuch, ko u ng’olyotab Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
